  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pi̱ rɛy pa̱a̱m",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ben rɛy dɔaar Dhin kɛ pay in jio̱liɛn, kä cukɛ ben cieŋ kä Ka-dɛc. Kä cu Mir-yam li̱w thi̱n, kä cua jɛ kony thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ cuɛ thil pi̱w kɛ kui̱ dolä. Kä cukɛ rɔ dol kɛɛl gakɛ kɛ Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ä-ron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ gaak kɛ Muthɛ wäkɛ i̱, “Ci ŋua̱n ni mi ca̱kɔ li̱w, mëë li̱w gaatmanikɔ nhiam Kuɔth Nhial! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋu no̱o̱ŋi nɛɛ Kuɔth Nhial rɛy dɔaarɔ kɛ ɣöö ba̱kɔ ben li̱w thi̱n ɔ, kɔn kɛ ɣɔ̱ɔ̱k ɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛŋu curi kɔ jak kä bä raar kä I-jëp ɔ, a bikɔ nööŋ ɛn guäth ɛ jiääk ɛ mi ɔ? Gua̱a̱th mi thil bɛl, kɛnɛ jiɛɛn ŋɔ̱a̱p, kɛ dɔŋpinyni. Kä thilɛ jɛ pi̱ ti mathkɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ä-ron jiɛɛn rɛy dolä kä cukɛ ben thok kɛmɛkä ro̱mä kɛ Kuoth Nhial, kä cukɛ pal. Kä cu buay Kuɔth Nhial päl kä kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Käni kɛɛt, kä wër dol nɛy diaal yɛnɛ dämuɔɔr ni Ä-ron, kä ruacni kɛ päm kä bikɛ pi̱kɛ nɛn kɛ waaŋdiɛn. Inɔ bi pi̱w ka̱m raar rɛy pa̱a̱m. Kä bi nɛy diaal cu maath amäni ɣɔ̱ɔ̱kiɛn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ kɛɛt ka̱n nhiam Kuɔth Nhial ce̱tkɛ min cɛ la̱r jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ä-ron nɛy diaal mat nhiam pa̱a̱m, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Liɛŋɛ jɛ täämɛ yɛn nɛy ti la malɛ luɔc ti. No̱ŋ nɛy yɛ pi̱w ɛn rɛy pa̱a̱m ɛmɛ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ päm yɔ̱t kä rɛw kɛ kɛɛtdɛ. Kä cu pi̱w ben raar, kä cu nɛy diaal maath amäni ɣɔ̱ɔ̱kiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ä-ron jiök i̱, “Kɛ ɣöö/ci yɛn ɣä ŋäth, kä /ci yɛn ɣä luth ala mi rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ waaŋ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ /cia nɛy ti̱ti̱ diaal bi naŋ muun in cä ka̱m kɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ti̱ti̱ a pi̱ Mɛ-ri-baa mëë gak ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ Kuoth Nhial, kä cuɛ rɔ nyoth rɛydiɛn ala mi rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pen Ɛ-dɔm ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ naath ja̱k kä Ka-dɛc jäkɛ kɛ kä kuäär Ɛ-dɔm wee i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ min laar dämuɔɔr ni I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ. Ji̱n ŋäci bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈c diaal tëë ca nɛy jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci gua̱nikɔ wä kä I-jëp kä ca̱kɔ wä cieŋ ɛn wi̱n ɛ mi kɛ pek mi bäär. Kä cu ji̱ I-jëp nɛy kɛ gua̱nikɔ ciɛŋ a jiäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca̱kɔ wiee nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, cuɛ jɔwda liŋ, kä cuɛ jääk ja̱k cuɛ nɛy ben ka̱m raar kä I-jëp. Kä kɔn täämɛ te nɛy kä Ka-dɛc, wec ɛ te këth wecdu mi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ jaknikɔ kä wä kɛ mundu. /Ca̱kɔ bi wä kɛ rɛy kakä kiɛ kak wal kɛ kui̱ kɔaŋ, kä /ca̱kɔ bi maath kɛ pi̱ rɛy jieeriku. Bakɔ wä kɛ duɔ̱p kua̱r in di̱i̱t, /ca̱kɔ rɔ bi riet cuëëc kiɛ caam, amäni mi ca̱kɔ wecdu bäl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ-dɔm ɛ loc i̱, “/Ci bi rët kɛ wecdä, mi wi̱i̱ wä ben kɛ jɛ, bä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ jiök i̱, “Bakɔ wä kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p in di̱i̱t. Kä mi wä maath kɛ pi̱ kɔnɛ ɣɔ̱ɔ̱kä, bäkɛ pik, jakni ni ɣä kä wä kärɔa a thilɛ mi dɔ̱ŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ loc i̱, “/Ci bi wä.” Kä cu Ɛ-dɔm ben raar kä kɛ, kɛ rɛm mi di̱i̱t mi bum bum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä niɛ mëë ci Ɛ-dɔm kɛ pën wä kɛ wecdɛ. Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ̱ ri̱t kä kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ Ä-ron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu duɔl I-thɛ-rɛl kɛɛliw jiɛɛn kä Ka-dɛc, cukɛ ben kä Päm Ɣor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ä-ron Pääm Ɣor, këth muɔ̱ɔ̱n Ɛ-dɔm wee i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bi Ä-ron li̱w. Kɛ ɣöö /cɛ bi wä muun in cä ka̱m ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛ ɣöö cia ruacdä lo̱k pi̱i̱ni Mɛ-ri-baa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Käni Ä-ron kɛnɛ gatdɛ ni Ɛl-a-dhar, kä naŋnikɛ Pääm Ɣor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä woc bieyni Ä-ron, kä läthnikɛ puɔ̱ny gatdɛ ni Ɛl-a-dhar. Kä bi Ä-ron li̱w ɛn wi̱ni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ ɛ la̱t ce̱tnikɛ min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r jɛ. Kä cukɛ wä pääm Ɣor nhiam nɛɛni diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ bieyni Ä-ron ka̱m raar, kä cuɛ kɛ la̱th puɔ̱ny gatdɛ ni Ɛl-a-dhar. Kä cu Ä-ron li̱w nhial wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m ɛn wi̱ni. Kä cu Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ɛl-a-dhar ben piny wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci duɔl ɛ nɛn kɛɛliw ɛn ɣöö ci Ä-ron li̱w, cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal Ä-ron par kɛ ni̱n ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
